    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d475">

                <pb facs="1291" n="1285" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg1285"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Willis to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 20.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Honolulu, Hawaiian Islands</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1893-12-26"><hi rendition="#italic">December
                                26, 1893</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The <hi rendition="#italic">Corwin</hi> did
                    not leave until 4 a.m. December 24. I delivered the dispatches 14 to 19,
                    inclusive, and telegram, with files of Hawaiian newspapers, to Capt. Munger in
                    person. This delay was caused by the failure of the Provisional Government to
                    deliver its answer to the President’s decision.</p>
                <p>This morning I acknowledged the receipt of its answer, with the information that
                    a copy thereof had been forwarded to you as above. I inclose my letter.</p>
                <p>On the same day I notified the Queen, through Mr. J. O Carter, of the result. I
                    inclose the letter to Mr. Carter.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Albert S. Willis</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Envoy Extraordinary and Minister Plenipotentiary,
                            United States of America.</hi></signed></closer>




                <xi:include href="d475-a1.xml" xpointer="d475-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d475-a2.xml" xpointer="d475-a2"/>
